Priests are pretty tough opponents for early characters. They have
pretty good AC, hit quite hard and cast some really irritating spells,
like "summon insects".

And yes, there can be penalties for killing a priest under some
circumstances. Googling something like "'nethack spoilers' 'you
murderer' priest" will get you some relevent information.
Anyway, when killing priests, it's often best to get someone else to do
it. Either tame a sufficiently nasty beastie or use conflict. Might be
interesting to set the minetown watch onto the priest and see who wins-
actually, either way you win: Both the priest and the watch carry items
worth picking up.



